Subject: [PATCH] Balance against a hegemon (AI_BALANCE_SHARE)

A team that has met a hegemon (the strongest team met, above
AI_BALANCE_SHARE per mille of the known power) acts on it in
CvTeamAI::AI_doWar in three ways:
- its no-war rolls against the hegemon drop by ten per point of the
  leader's envy of better-ranked players (unchanged at Friendly, and
  for leaders without envy);
- the dogpile power test against the hegemon also counts the AI teams
  that would join it this turn (their own dogpile roll passes);
- a team whose war plans are all against weaker teams may still join
  against the hegemon, by the dogpile path only.
At 0 the define leaves AI_doWar as before. The default is 110.

Serves: P5

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
